WEBVTT

00:00:10.292 --> 00:00:12.503
[gasps and grunting]

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:19.468
[grunts]

00:00:22.346 --> 00:00:23.889
[panting]

00:00:26.559 --> 00:00:27.768
[gulps]

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:38.821
[grunts]

00:00:50.708 --> 00:00:51.959
[purrs softly]

00:00:55.171 --> 00:00:56.172
[twig snaps]

00:00:57.173 --> 00:00:58.424
[grunts inquisitively]

00:01:00.259 --> 00:01:01.635
[purrs]

00:01:06.390 --> 00:01:08.017
[grunting]

00:01:19.612 --> 00:01:20.821
[sneezes]

00:01:21.864 --> 00:01:23.199
[grunts]

00:01:34.126 --> 00:01:35.461
[grunts]

00:01:43.719 --> 00:01:45.262
[whinnies softly]

00:01:50.893 --> 00:01:51.894
[grunts]

00:01:54.438 --> 00:01:55.731
[warbles]

00:01:58.984 --> 00:02:00.277
[croaks]

00:02:01.070 --> 00:02:02.446
[grunts]

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:07.326
[grunting]

00:02:07.409 --> 00:02:08.577
[low growl]

00:02:10.037 --> 00:02:11.497
[growls softly]

00:02:20.422 --> 00:02:21.840
[grunts softly]

00:02:35.271 --> 00:02:37.273
[branch creaking]

00:02:40.526 --> 00:02:41.610
[grunts]

00:02:44.405 --> 00:02:46.282
[branch creaking]

00:02:46.365 --> 00:02:47.700
[grunts]

00:02:48.993 --> 00:02:50.995
[creaking intensifies]

00:02:51.578 --> 00:02:52.788
[purrs softly]

00:02:56.166 --> 00:02:57.543
[yowls]

00:02:59.878 --> 00:03:00.713
[yelps]

00:03:03.716 --> 00:03:04.800
[grunts]

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:18.731
[grunts]

00:03:42.004 --> 00:03:43.630
[purrs happily]

00:03:45.883 --> 00:03:46.967
[grunts]

00:03:54.016 --> 00:03:56.101
Oh, now you can draw.

00:03:59.229 --> 00:04:01.482
[both growling]

00:04:06.111 --> 00:04:07.446
[purrs softly]

00:04:10.783 --> 00:04:12.576
[purring]

00:04:15.996 --> 00:04:17.956
[both sniffing]

00:04:20.959 --> 00:04:22.211
[purrs softly]

00:04:26.173 --> 00:04:27.883
[whinnies softly]

00:04:30.010 --> 00:04:31.428
[grunts]

00:04:37.851 --> 00:04:39.228
[grunts]

00:04:39.311 --> 00:04:41.480
[both calling]

00:04:46.360 --> 00:04:47.653
[snarls]

00:04:53.117 --> 00:04:54.868
[roars]

00:04:55.285 --> 00:04:57.538
[squawking]

00:05:00.249 --> 00:05:01.542
[groans]

00:05:03.669 --> 00:05:05.003
[whines]

00:05:06.296 --> 00:05:07.631
[sighs]

00:05:17.099 --> 00:05:19.101
Oh. Someone hasn't slept.

00:05:19.184 --> 00:05:22.396
Yeah. Well, that Light Fury
won't let me within a mile of her.

00:05:22.479 --> 00:05:24.273
And neither of us
will be getting any sleep

00:05:24.356 --> 00:05:26.984
or finding the Hidden World
until Toothless takes over.

00:05:27.484 --> 00:05:28.694
Hey!

00:05:28.777 --> 00:05:30.904
-What do you think of that?
-[grunts]

00:05:31.071 --> 00:05:33.073
-Yeah. [grunts]
-[grunts]

00:05:33.157 --> 00:05:35.450
You tried this once before.
He didn't want it.

00:05:35.534 --> 00:05:38.829
[sighs] Well, until now
he didn't have a reason to.

00:05:39.121 --> 00:05:40.289
Right, bud?

00:05:47.171 --> 00:05:48.255
[chuckles softly]

00:05:48.338 --> 00:05:49.506
What?

00:05:49.590 --> 00:05:52.092
No, nothing. I'm... I'm impressed.

00:05:52.176 --> 00:05:53.635
I mean, look at you.

00:05:53.719 --> 00:05:56.805
Embracing change. I am proud of you.

00:05:56.889 --> 00:05:58.765
Well, he's my best bud.

00:05:59.308 --> 00:06:00.767
I want him to be happy.

00:06:01.560 --> 00:06:03.687
Eh, besides,
it's just until he brings her back.

00:06:06.106 --> 00:06:07.232
[sighs]

00:06:08.692 --> 00:06:10.027
-All right.
-[Gobber groans]

00:06:10.110 --> 00:06:11.778
-Fire when ready.
-Oh!

00:06:17.743 --> 00:06:20.829
Well, I guess you know
the tail is fireproof.

00:06:21.496 --> 00:06:23.415
-Okay, Toothless.
-[grunting happily]

00:06:23.498 --> 00:06:25.959
-Okay, okay. Yes, I know. I know.
-[grunts]

00:06:26.043 --> 00:06:28.420
Shh! Okay, I know.

00:06:29.588 --> 00:06:31.757
-Please, this is not helping.
-[Eret] Well, well, well.

00:06:31.840 --> 00:06:33.425
Someone's excited.

00:06:33.592 --> 00:06:35.969
[sighs] He's fresh off his first date.

00:06:36.053 --> 00:06:37.930
Now he's love crazed.

00:06:38.013 --> 00:06:40.182
Only we're the ones going crazy.

00:06:40.265 --> 00:06:42.809
The sooner he brings back
that Light Fury, the better.

00:06:42.893 --> 00:06:45.771
Yeah, but to do that,
he'll need to fly without me.

00:06:45.854 --> 00:06:48.732
So time to give this new
and improved baby a shot.

00:06:48.815 --> 00:06:50.442
[grunts and sniffs]

00:06:50.525 --> 00:06:53.403
Attaboy. Looking sharp, Toothless.

00:06:54.488 --> 00:06:55.864
So what do you think, bud?

00:06:56.907 --> 00:06:58.116
Bring her home.

00:06:58.200 --> 00:06:59.993
[imitates Stoick]
By sundown at the latest.

00:07:00.077 --> 00:07:01.536
[coos]

00:07:01.620 --> 00:07:05.582
[groans] No, save it for your girlfriend.
Go on. Get out of here.

00:07:11.255 --> 00:07:12.589
[groans meekly]

00:07:13.882 --> 00:07:14.883
It's okay.

00:07:14.967 --> 00:07:16.093
[grunts]

00:07:18.095 --> 00:07:19.846
[roars]

